:26.737" end="00:26.892">the </span><span begin="00:26.892" end="00:27.043">sun </span><span begin="00:27.043" end="00:27.298">comes </span><span begin="00:27.450" end="00:27.755">shining </span><span begin="00:27.755" end="00:28.462">through</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.002" end="00:33.531"><span begin="00:31.002" end="00:31.154">To </span><span begin="00:31.154" end="00:31.306">make </span><span begin="00:31.306" end="00:31.460">those </span><span begin="00:31.460" end="00:32.014">rainbows </span><span begin="00:32.217" end="00:32.569">in </span><span begin="00:32.569" end="00:32.975">my </span><span begin="00:32.975" end="00:33.531">mind</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.836" end="00:35.859"><span begin="00:33.836" end="00:33.986">When </span><span begin="00:33.986" end="00:34.087">I </span><span begin="00:34.087" end="00:34.391">think </span><span begin="00:34.593" end="00:34.794">of </span><span begin="00:34.947" end="00:35.150">you </span><span begin="00:35.150" end="00:35.859">sometime</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.112" end="00:38.386"><span begin="00:36.112" end="00:36.263">And </span><span begin="00:36.263" end="00:36.415">I </span><span begin="00:36.415" end="00:36.565">want </span><span begin="00:36.565" end="00:36.769">to </span><span begin="00:36.769" end="00:36.970">spend </span><span begin="00:37.124" end="00:37.274">some </span><span begin="00:37.274" end="00:37.528">time </span><span begin="00:37.680" end="00:37.931">with </span><span begin="00:37.931" end="00:38.386">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.842" end="00:41.565"><span begin="00:39.842" end="00:40.045">Just </span><span begin="00:40.045" end="00:40.301">the </span><span begin="00:40.301" end="00:40.554">two </span><span begin="00:40.909" end="00:41.313">of </span><span begin="00:41.313" end="00:41.565">us</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.528" end="00:44.600"><span begin="00:42.528" end="00:42.730">We </span><span begin="00:42.730" end="00:42.